Hi,

At the suggestion of Mac, WA4CAW, I have added a couple new features to
the twclock program.  The first sends your call in CW via the soundcard
for the ID timer.  The sound card audio can then be fed to your rig to
automatically transmit a station ID.

The second addition is an Auto Reset.  Once you start the ID timer, it
will automatically reset the timer when the alarm goes off - no need for
any user interaction.  Its great for rag chewing sessions.

It is available at:
http://wa0eir.ham.org


Enjoy and 73

